{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108270","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108270","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1110827001:0":{"text":"Foreign sage, future leader, why have you returned without your kin?","source_cn":"外来的智者，未来的领袖，你们回来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD34098A148F28E2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110827002:0":{"text":"The Quicksand Claws transported the captured Maulers ahead of schedule so I didn't find them.","source_cn":"没找到人。流沙之爪把被俘获的蛮血提前转运走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E1D69B766C4A96B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110827003:0":{"text":"I'm not surprised. The Quicksand Claws are well-organized and efficient now.","source_cn":"我并不意外……那些流沙之爪统合严密，行动有序，和之前判...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE18CFFDBC6AD7101","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110827004:0":{"text":"Let's hope <style=\"highlight\">Ugar</style> and your people are safe...","source_cn":"只盼望<style=highlight>被俘获的乌格尔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BFACC157973FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110827005:0":{"text":"Soren, you're back! And you brought back the big brothers from the caravans!","source_cn":"索恩哥哥，你回来了！还带着商队的大哥哥们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1CB113062BC32E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110827006:0":{"text":"Hmm... Where are Jerry and Carley?","source_cn":"咦，但是扎拉和卡阿他们不在……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD2EF97B21D6FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110827007:0":{"text":"They've been taken to a farther place.","source_cn":"他们被带到更远的地方去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x235453084B5275F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110827008:0":{"text":"What... What do we do? Soren, take me with you! Let's find everyone together!","source_cn":"那、那怎么办？索恩哥哥，我和你一起去吧！我们一起去把大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70FCBA0C9B3E3E4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110827009:0":{"text":"No...","source_cn":"……不行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE840D019A0820496","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110827010:0":{"text":"Don't get involved anymore, I'll go look for them.","source_cn":"不要再牵扯进寻宝里，人我去找。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8927CAF3F40D7DF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110827011:0":{"text":"You stay here and wait for me.","source_cn":"你在这里待好，我没带人回来，就哪里都不要去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D054CB4050D3DA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110827012:0":{"text":"Hey, kiddo, did you all just tag along with the caravans because you heard there's treasure in the Eroded Enclave?","source_cn":"嘿，小鬼头，你们是听说风蚀飞地有宝藏，就脑子一热，跟着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB527A0BA00A1C29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110827013:0":{"text":"Listen up, finding treasure isn't child's play. You need guts and brains. Even your big brother doesn't have the knack for it, let alone you.","source_cn":"听着，要找到宝藏，勇气，胆量，智慧都必不可缺。你大哥都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x012C63A596221A92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1110827013":{"text":"Listen up, finding treasure isn't child's play. You need guts and brains. Even your big brother doesn't have the knack for it, let alone you.","source_cn":"听着，要找到宝藏，勇气，胆量，智慧都必不可缺。你大哥都没这个脑筋，你就更不行了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x012C63A596221A92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110827014:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110827016:0":{"text":"I'll give you a choice now, do you want the treasure, or do you want your big brother Soren? It's up to you.","source_cn":"小鬼头，现在给你个选择，要宝藏，还是要你索恩大哥？你选吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB6A9E9D62A23844","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110827017:0":{"text":"Soren, of course! We wanted to find the treasure to make Soren and Alsa happier!","source_cn":"当、当然是索恩哥哥！我们想找到宝藏，也是想让索恩哥哥和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAEF1A6CE3E33197","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110827018:0":{"text":"Okay. But if you stick with Soren right now, he'll be too busy looking out for you.","source_cn":"好。那我告诉你，凭现在的你，如果和索恩一起上路，只能让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCD3F0F11D7F6B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110827019:0":{"text":"If things get rough, he'll take the hit, not you.","source_cn":"如果面临危机，受伤的会是他自己，不是你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75594831FC7E7BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110827020:0":{"text":"Hey Soren, don't give me that look. I'm just stating the facts. The rest is up to you to handle.","source_cn":"索恩小哥，别瞪我，我就说这么多。剩下是你们氏族的事，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9CEE7F55C155C16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110827021:0":{"text":"Simba...","source_cn":"……小瑟巴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CDF58C95FB2F638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1110827022:0":{"text":"Everything we do is for the good of the clan, whether it's you or me, the Warsong Festival or treasure hunting, it's all the same. Alsa and I won't blame you.","source_cn":"我们做的一切都是为了氏族，战歌节、寻宝，都一样。我和阿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BABB052BB0E9E42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110827023:0":{"text":"But, as Pops used to say, \"Victors must stay humble.\"","source_cn":"但是，老爹曾说，“赢的人要懂得谦卑”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x254679F6AA8E7392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1110827024:0":{"text":"\"And those who lose must acknowledge their weaknesses...\"